   deleted.

5. This document grants no rights to Poiema's names, trademarks, logos or
   visual identity.

6. The Material is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

Third-party components keep their own licenses. The Inter Tight typeface
(SIL Open Font License 1.1) is not distributed in this repository; it is
loaded from Google Fonts or installed separately.
